#: src/features/analytics/Settings.tsx
msgid "A change applies to new events. Days already counted keep their zone."
msgstr "Perubahan berlaku untuk peristiwa baru. Hari yang sudah dihitung mempertahankan zonanya."

#: src/features/analytics/Goals.tsx
msgid "A changed goal is counted again over the days the detailed records are kept."
msgstr "Sasaran yang diubah dihitung lagi selama hari-hari catatan terperinci disimpan."

#: src/features/analytics/Funnels.tsx
msgid "A funnel follows each visit step by step, so it covers at most 90 days at once, or 31 days for a property with more than 10 million events a month. Pick a shorter range."
msgstr "Corong mengikuti setiap kunjungan langkah demi langkah, jadi mencakup paling lama 90 hari sekaligus, atau 31 hari untuk properti dengan lebih dari 10 juta peristiwa sebulan. Pilih rentang yang lebih pendek."

#: src/features/analytics/Funnels.tsx
msgid "A funnel is made of two to eight goals in a row. Make at least two goals first."
msgstr "Corong terdiri dari dua sampai delapan sasaran berurutan. Buat setidaknya dua sasaran dulu."

#: src/features/analytics/Funnels.tsx
msgid "A funnel needs each visit’s steps, which are kept since {day}. Earlier days only have totals, so they cannot show a funnel."
msgstr "Corong membutuhkan langkah setiap kunjungan, yang disimpan sejak {day}. Hari-hari sebelumnya hanya punya total, jadi tidak dapat menampilkan corong."

#: src/features/analytics/Funnels.tsx
msgid "A funnel needs each visit’s steps, which are no longer kept for this range."
msgstr "Corong membutuhkan langkah setiap kunjungan, yang tidak lagi disimpan untuk rentang ini."

#: src/features/analytics/Funnels.tsx
msgid "A funnel shows how many visitors go from one goal to the next within a visit, and where they leave."
msgstr "Corong menunjukkan berapa banyak pengunjung berpindah dari satu sasaran ke sasaran berikutnya dalam satu kunjungan, dan di mana mereka pergi."

#: src/features/analytics/Goals.tsx
msgid "A goal counts the visitors who view a page, send an event or scroll far enough, and the revenue they bring."
msgstr "Sasaran menghitung pengunjung yang melihat halaman, mengirim peristiwa, atau menggulir cukup jauh, dan pendapatan yang mereka bawa."

#: src/features/analytics/Alerts.tsx
msgid "A goal’s conversions yesterday were at most half its daily average of the week before."
msgstr "Konversi sasaran kemarin paling banyak setengah dari rata-rata hariannya pada minggu sebelumnya."

#: src/features/analytics/Sharing.tsx
msgid "A link shows only its views of this property, read-only, without filters or segments. Revoking or deleting it stops it at once."
msgstr "Tautan hanya menampilkan tayangan properti ini, hanya-baca, tanpa filter atau segmen. Mencabut atau menghapusnya menghentikannya seketika."

#: src/features/analytics/Goals.tsx
msgid "A new goal also counts the days the detailed records are kept, not only from today."
msgstr "Sasaran baru juga menghitung hari-hari catatan terperinci disimpan, bukan hanya mulai hari ini."

